WEBVTT

00:00:08.310 --> 00:00:11.690
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:17.200
<i>tsukanoma no yasuragi mo furikitte</i>
Shaking off the desire to rest

00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:23.370
<i>hitasura massugu ni hashiri tsuzuketa</i>
I resume my forward journey

00:00:23.370 --> 00:00:26.500
<i>nagareru ase nuguwazuni</i>
Without wiping the sweat off my brow

00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:34.550
<i>butsukarukotode fukaku musubitsuku yuujou</i>
The friendship that grows through fighting

00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:40.640
<i>kizutsuitakoto wa mudaja nakattane</i>
Getting hurt was never a waste

00:00:42.560 --> 00:00:45.560
<i>kanashimi ni kureta toki</i>
When you're wallowing in sorrow

00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:49.690
<i>sotto te o sashinobete miyou</i>
Let's reach out with your hand

00:00:49.900 --> 00:00:52.900
<i>kitto itsumademo tomo wa</i>
I'm sure friends will be there

00:00:52.900 --> 00:00:57.160
<i>kimi o mimamotte iru</i>
Watching over you

00:00:57.320 --> 00:01:00.580
<i>hitorija naikara</i>
Since we are not alone

00:01:00.580 --> 00:01:04.580
<i>chikaiaou kitto</i>
Let's swear to each other

00:01:04.580 --> 00:01:09.330
<i>itsuka jidai ga kawattemo</i>
That even when times change

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:12.340
<i>boku wa wasurenai</i>
I will never forget you

00:01:12.710 --> 00:01:16.590
I trust you forever

00:01:23.720 --> 00:01:25.680
Now, everyone.

00:01:25.680 --> 00:01:28.940
The Final Battle Royale
is finally underway!

00:01:28.940 --> 00:01:31.650
The levels of the battles
are reaching a climax.

00:01:32.610 --> 00:01:36.530
The battle is on Lantau Island,
west of Hong Kong.

00:02:06.600 --> 00:02:08.310
That was quite an impact!

00:02:09.020 --> 00:02:11.770
I can only think of one thing
with that much power.

00:02:12.390 --> 00:02:13.150
My crest!

00:02:13.650 --> 00:02:15.650
Devil Gundam is here!

00:02:21.990 --> 00:02:23.950
Devil Gundam has come out!

00:02:23.950 --> 00:02:26.160
No, that's not all.

00:02:26.790 --> 00:02:28.540
One of the four evil kings!

00:02:28.540 --> 00:02:31.750
Gundam Heaven's Sword
has arrived with claws sharpened...

00:02:31.750 --> 00:02:34.000
...ready to attack Domon!

00:02:35.040 --> 00:02:36.500
And now!

00:02:36.670 --> 00:02:37.800
Gundam Fight!

00:02:37.800 --> 00:02:40.720
Ready! Go!

00:02:40.720 --> 00:02:46.760
Assault of the Four Evil Kings!
Gundam Heaven's Sword

00:02:51.140 --> 00:02:53.340
Domon Kasshu!

00:02:53.340 --> 00:02:54.230
Michelo!

00:03:12.710 --> 00:03:13.460
That's...!

00:03:13.880 --> 00:03:15.960
This is it for you!

00:03:16.210 --> 00:03:18.170
You're going down, Domon!

00:03:18.170 --> 00:03:18.920
You wish!

00:03:25.180 --> 00:03:27.810
Long time no see, Dr. Mikamura.

00:03:28.770 --> 00:03:31.230
I can't believe you're conscious,
Schwarz.

00:03:31.390 --> 00:03:32.980
Or rather, Kyoji.

00:03:33.390 --> 00:03:36.360
I haven't been called
by that name in ages.

00:03:44.610 --> 00:03:47.280
I haven't got time to waste here.

00:03:50.790 --> 00:03:53.080
You mustn't move
in your present condition.

00:03:56.460 --> 00:03:58.290
I imagine there's a short circuit...

00:03:58.290 --> 00:04:01.550
...in the nerve relay terminal
of your power supply.

00:04:03.420 --> 00:04:07.260
Still planning to stop me,
even in the state you're in?

00:04:07.930 --> 00:04:09.180
Cursed android!

00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:12.600
Doctor!

00:04:12.600 --> 00:04:14.140
What're you doing?!

00:04:15.190 --> 00:04:15.940
Don't worry.

00:04:16.190 --> 00:04:18.020
I'll fix you for good!

00:04:24.740 --> 00:04:29.660
You don't even have the strength
to fight me off.

00:04:30.450 --> 00:04:34.160
If you must blame someone,
blame your father, Dr. Kasshu.

00:04:34.750 --> 00:04:37.500
If only he hadn't created
Devil Gundam!

00:04:39.340 --> 00:04:42.420
I shall eliminate anyone
who knows the truth...

00:04:42.420 --> 00:04:43.970
...about the Devil Gundam incident!

00:04:43.970 --> 00:04:44.590
Father!

00:04:47.930 --> 00:04:48.890
Rain...

00:04:49.390 --> 00:04:50.970
Why are you doing this?

00:04:56.980 --> 00:04:57.980
Up yours!

00:04:57.980 --> 00:05:00.650
Heaven's Tornado!

00:05:06.530 --> 00:05:07.820
What's wrong, Domon?

00:05:08.490 --> 00:05:12.410
Keep struggling down there
and you'll never fight me!

00:05:12.660 --> 00:05:14.200
Wind Fire!

00:05:17.920 --> 00:05:20.290
These lame moves can't defeat me!

00:05:20.960 --> 00:05:22.500
Eat shit!

00:05:28.300 --> 00:05:29.260
Michelo!

00:05:29.260 --> 00:05:31.260
Why did you sell your soul
to the devil?

00:05:31.640 --> 00:05:33.010
I told you!

00:05:33.010 --> 00:05:35.180
So I could defeat you!

00:05:39.400 --> 00:05:40.480
Father.

00:05:40.650 --> 00:05:41.940
Wh-why?

00:05:46.030 --> 00:05:48.070
I'll tell you why, Rain.

00:05:53.160 --> 00:05:57.160
It all started when Devil Gundam
had just been completed.

00:05:58.160 --> 00:06:02.040
At first, it wasn't even called
Devil Gundam.

00:06:04.090 --> 00:06:05.960
<i>It's finally done</i>.

00:06:05.960 --> 00:06:07.510
<i>Ultimate Gundam</i>.

00:06:15.140 --> 00:06:16.770
<i>Kyoji! Hurry! Go!</i>

00:06:17.100 --> 00:06:18.520
<i>But what about you two?!</i>

00:06:19.060 --> 00:06:21.230
<i>We mustn't let the army</i>
<i>use this for evil!</i>

00:06:23.980 --> 00:06:25.150
<i>Don't resist!</i>

00:06:25.400 --> 00:06:27.400
<i>We're confiscating this beast!</i>

00:06:30.110 --> 00:06:31.700
<i>Let go! Let go!</i>

00:06:33.620 --> 00:06:34.950
<i>You evil fiends!</i>

00:06:38.620 --> 00:06:39.960
<i>Mikamura!</i>

00:06:40.210 --> 00:06:41.370
<i>Why are you</i>...

00:06:43.750 --> 00:06:44.790
<i>Don't let him escape!</i>

00:06:44.790 --> 00:06:45.210
<i>Fire!</i>

00:06:46.880 --> 00:06:47.960
<i>Stop it!</i>

00:06:48.760 --> 00:06:49.590
<i>Mom!</i>

00:06:52.390 --> 00:06:54.970
Mom was shot trying to protect me.

00:06:56.060 --> 00:07:00.230
Dad was sentenced to
a cryogenic state, to silence him.

00:07:02.310 --> 00:07:03.860
And I...

00:07:05.320 --> 00:07:10.110
...I escaped to Earth with Ultimate Gundam.

00:07:14.570 --> 00:07:17.830
This was all a plot hatched
by Ulube and Dr. Mikamura.

00:07:19.410 --> 00:07:20.540
That's a lie!

00:07:20.870 --> 00:07:22.420
It can't be true!

00:07:23.250 --> 00:07:25.080
Father would never do such a thing.

00:07:25.540 --> 00:07:28.020
You were the last person
I wanted to know about this.

00:07:29.510 --> 00:07:31.840
Wh-why did you do it?

00:07:34.720 --> 00:07:38.390
I... I couldn't take it.

00:07:38.770 --> 00:07:41.810
I was so envious
of Dr. Kasshu's skills.

00:07:42.940 --> 00:07:48.320
He could even point out faults
in the Shining Gundam I made.

00:07:48.650 --> 00:07:53.280
<i>This Emotion Energy System</i>
<i>only works with the power of anger</i>.

00:07:53.740 --> 00:07:55.240
<i>As it stands, it's incomplete</i>.

00:07:55.370 --> 00:08:00.080
Dr. Kasshu was always
a step or two ahead of me.

00:08:01.120 --> 00:08:04.370
Before I knew it, my jealousy
had turned into hatred.

00:08:06.540 --> 00:08:11.210
And when I saw Dr. Kasshu's Gundam,
that hatred reached a peak.

00:08:11.510 --> 00:08:12.590
And it exploded.

00:08:15.760 --> 00:08:19.810
I wanted to make his research my own!

00:08:22.270 --> 00:08:23.520
Self-recover!

00:08:27.110 --> 00:08:28.480
Self-multiply!

00:08:32.030 --> 00:08:36.570
And the last of the three great
theoretical abilities, self-evolve!

00:08:45.710 --> 00:08:49.170
No matter what it took...
no matter how...

00:08:49.920 --> 00:08:52.510
I wanted those theories for myself!

00:08:58.140 --> 00:08:59.390
So that's why.

00:09:00.300 --> 00:09:03.520
That's why you got us
to enter the Gundam Fight.

00:09:03.930 --> 00:09:07.810
So we'd assist you in hunting out
and capturing Devil Gundam!

00:09:09.810 --> 00:09:12.570
You tricked the innocent Kasshu family!

00:09:13.110 --> 00:09:16.070
You've made Domon and Kyoji
suffer all this time.

00:09:16.650 --> 00:09:17.700
Rain...

00:09:18.360 --> 00:09:19.370
That's cruel.

00:09:19.870 --> 00:09:21.200
That's way too cruel.

00:09:23.620 --> 00:09:26.830
There was no one more capable
than Domon.

00:09:27.620 --> 00:09:30.630
And I figured, if you were with him...

00:09:30.630 --> 00:09:33.300
...you would keep me updated
on his movements.

00:09:33.880 --> 00:09:37.880
I wasn't comfortable
with the idea of using you.

00:09:38.970 --> 00:09:41.510
But it was an order from Ulube,
so I had no choice.

00:09:41.800 --> 00:09:43.510
You're just as guilty!

00:09:44.810 --> 00:09:46.270
But Rain...

00:09:46.270 --> 00:09:47.940
You can't talk yourself out of this one!

00:09:49.900 --> 00:09:51.810
I wanted it so badly.

00:09:52.110 --> 00:09:55.230
And I couldn't allow anyone
to get his hands on it!

00:09:55.650 --> 00:09:56.860
You're right!

00:09:56.860 --> 00:09:58.790
We can't allow anyone to get it!

00:09:58.790 --> 00:10:00.910
Including you and Ulube!

00:10:01.620 --> 00:10:04.290
That's why I must go.

00:10:05.620 --> 00:10:07.080
Rain! Please!

00:10:07.410 --> 00:10:08.410
Huh?!

00:10:15.760 --> 00:10:18.970
My dear Gundam Heaven's Sword.

00:10:19.300 --> 00:10:20.840
You're incredible.

00:10:32.270 --> 00:10:33.150
Chew on this!

00:10:33.480 --> 00:10:36.570
Hyper Silver Feet Special!

00:10:46.370 --> 00:10:48.910
He's nothing like he used to be!

00:10:49.250 --> 00:10:52.290
DG cells are making him so
powerful he's off the scale!

00:10:52.830 --> 00:10:54.540
How can I possibly defeat him?!

00:10:54.920 --> 00:10:56.050
How?!

00:11:00.550 --> 00:11:01.800
You sure about this?

00:11:02.010 --> 00:11:03.680
Yeah! Please!

00:11:04.680 --> 00:11:07.310
It might seem brutal,
but you've gotta hit me.

00:11:09.020 --> 00:11:10.230
Do it.

00:11:10.230 --> 00:11:11.390
W-wait.

00:11:11.390 --> 00:11:13.650
I'm not listening to anything
you have to say.

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:18.740
Hurry!

00:11:18.740 --> 00:11:19.900
Domon needs my help!

00:11:40.380 --> 00:11:42.130
Goodbye, Domon!

00:11:43.260 --> 00:11:45.970
E-Erupting...

00:11:46.270 --> 00:11:49.960
...God Finger!

00:11:51.230 --> 00:11:52.100
Missed him!

00:11:52.520 --> 00:11:54.100
Die!

00:12:06.410 --> 00:12:09.660
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:12:10.290 --> 00:12:11.660
Die!

00:12:16.380 --> 00:12:17.710
This is...!

00:12:22.130 --> 00:12:22.920
What?!

00:12:26.820 --> 00:12:28.430
Th-this technique...

00:12:28.570 --> 00:12:29.510
Argo!

00:12:36.940 --> 00:12:38.310
Damn you!

00:12:42.110 --> 00:12:43.110
Yahoo!

00:12:43.550 --> 00:12:44.360
Sai Saici!

00:12:44.900 --> 00:12:47.820
Didn't forget I'm here, too!

00:12:47.990 --> 00:12:49.910
You little creep!

00:12:55.000 --> 00:12:57.420
What's Devil Gundam
doing on Lantau Island?

00:12:58.260 --> 00:12:59.590
Hey!

00:13:05.220 --> 00:13:06.760
Don't hesitate!

00:13:06.760 --> 00:13:09.270
We were rescued, too.

00:13:11.470 --> 00:13:14.020
You know Domon too, right?

00:13:14.020 --> 00:13:15.890
Hurry on up, old lady.

00:13:16.520 --> 00:13:17.390
"Old lady"?

00:13:20.450 --> 00:13:21.520
Are we connected?!

00:13:21.670 --> 00:13:23.360
You contacting Lantau?!

00:13:23.900 --> 00:13:26.650
"Thank you" would've been nice.

00:13:26.650 --> 00:13:27.700
No manners.

00:13:28.390 --> 00:13:29.700
Argo and Sai Saici?!

00:13:31.830 --> 00:13:34.750
Looks like they've gone over
to save Mister Domon.

00:13:35.200 --> 00:13:36.910
That monster's appeared.

00:13:37.290 --> 00:13:39.790
So I guess they've decided
to join forces.

00:13:41.670 --> 00:13:44.420
If the Shuffle Alliance members
join forces...

00:13:44.420 --> 00:13:45.970
...they won't tolerate defeat.

00:13:57.980 --> 00:14:00.520
Are you guys here to help me?

00:14:00.770 --> 00:14:03.360
We're members of the Shuffle Alliance!

00:14:04.080 --> 00:14:06.320
Just what I was waiting to hear!

00:14:06.860 --> 00:14:09.160
Our crests haven't stopped shining!

00:14:09.660 --> 00:14:12.740
The bonds of the Shuffle Alliance
are bringing us together!

00:14:13.390 --> 00:14:14.870
Then let's do it!

00:14:14.870 --> 00:14:17.020
So what if he's one of the Four Kings?!

00:14:17.020 --> 00:14:18.580
He can't fool with us!

00:14:18.910 --> 00:14:20.630
You wish!

00:14:21.040 --> 00:14:23.420
I'll crush all three of you!

00:14:23.880 --> 00:14:24.710
Let's go!

00:14:24.710 --> 00:14:25.550
Yeah!

00:14:27.840 --> 00:14:29.630
Erupting...

00:14:30.260 --> 00:14:34.350
...God Finger!

00:14:35.350 --> 00:14:36.390
We did it!

00:14:36.390 --> 00:14:37.060
What?!

00:14:43.230 --> 00:14:45.480
It absorbed the God Finger energy!

00:14:47.110 --> 00:14:51.410
I'll show you the true strength
of Gundam Heaven's Sword!

00:15:02.830 --> 00:15:04.790
Sai Saici! Argo!

00:15:07.630 --> 00:15:09.220
What's wrong, Sai Saici?!

00:15:09.220 --> 00:15:10.220
Argo!

00:15:10.760 --> 00:15:13.550
What the hell's going on with that island?!

00:15:25.440 --> 00:15:26.650
I can't thank you enough.

00:15:27.610 --> 00:15:29.780
You really going, even in that condition?

00:15:30.490 --> 00:15:31.490
Yeah.

00:15:32.990 --> 00:15:35.380
At this point, I have no choice.

00:15:36.780 --> 00:15:38.910
Gundam!

00:15:44.080 --> 00:15:45.460
Goodbye, Rain!

00:16:00.850 --> 00:16:01.810
Kyoji...

00:16:16.570 --> 00:16:17.620
Right.

00:16:17.870 --> 00:16:19.870
I must let Domon know the truth.

00:16:20.580 --> 00:16:22.160
But how?

00:16:36.430 --> 00:16:39.100
I can't sit back and do nothing!

00:16:39.540 --> 00:16:41.560
Wait, Domon! I'll be right there!

00:16:46.650 --> 00:16:48.180
With the Rising Gundam!

00:16:53.950 --> 00:16:56.610
Domon! Leave this guy to us!

00:16:56.610 --> 00:16:59.370
Hurry on to where
Devil Gundam is, Bro!

00:16:59.580 --> 00:17:01.870
But I can't leave you guys here.

00:17:01.870 --> 00:17:03.370
What're you hesitating for?!

00:17:03.750 --> 00:17:07.540
It's our duty to defeat Devil Gundam!

00:17:07.920 --> 00:17:08.990
I know, but...

00:17:08.990 --> 00:17:11.170
There's no time to think!

00:17:11.880 --> 00:17:13.720
Sai Saici! Lend me a hand!

00:17:14.010 --> 00:17:15.260
I'm clearing a path through!

00:17:15.800 --> 00:17:16.800
Okay!

00:17:17.640 --> 00:17:18.760
Let's do it, Domon!

00:17:19.760 --> 00:17:20.760
Right!

00:17:21.720 --> 00:17:22.720
Triple...

00:17:22.720 --> 00:17:27.350
...Gaia Crusher!

00:17:38.200 --> 00:17:40.520
Now, Domon! Come!

00:17:41.990 --> 00:17:45.910
This rock tunnel will lead you
near the summit.

00:17:46.250 --> 00:17:48.000
Over my dead body!

00:17:50.540 --> 00:17:51.790
Hurry, Bro!

00:17:52.020 --> 00:17:53.130
Go, Domon!

00:17:54.170 --> 00:17:55.550
You guys...

00:17:59.970 --> 00:18:01.930
Th-thank you...

00:18:03.100 --> 00:18:05.560
I'm on my way!!

00:18:09.240 --> 00:18:10.860
"Thank you"?

00:18:11.150 --> 00:18:13.270
I'm the one who wants to thank you!

00:18:14.070 --> 00:18:19.610
You taught us the thrill
of being genuine Fighters!

00:18:20.950 --> 00:18:25.240
Also that much more than victory
can be gained from fighting.

00:18:33.210 --> 00:18:35.420
Wind Fire!

00:18:38.090 --> 00:18:39.470
Hey, mister!

00:18:40.010 --> 00:18:41.640
Can you afford to die?

00:18:42.390 --> 00:18:46.100
I can't afford to lose until I've
rescued my imprisoned friends!

00:18:48.310 --> 00:18:49.310
Same here.

00:18:49.730 --> 00:18:52.270
I'm not about to give in until
I revive the Shaolin Temple!

00:18:53.440 --> 00:18:56.900
Still, unless we defeat
this guy here and now...

00:18:56.900 --> 00:18:58.990
...we'll lose a lot more than
a shot at our dreams!

00:18:59.490 --> 00:19:00.740
That's why...

00:19:01.280 --> 00:19:03.120
Sai Saici, whaddaya say?!

00:19:03.520 --> 00:19:04.990
Let's do it, mister!

00:19:08.000 --> 00:19:12.130
Shin Ryusei Kochoken!

00:19:20.220 --> 00:19:23.140
Graviton Hammer!

00:19:25.640 --> 00:19:27.100
Here I go!

00:19:27.290 --> 00:19:28.100
What?!

00:19:41.320 --> 00:19:44.160
Trying to make me crash?!

00:19:47.040 --> 00:19:48.920
Come here, freaky bird!

00:19:48.920 --> 00:19:50.750
I'll make fried chicken outta you!

00:19:51.080 --> 00:19:53.540
Do they want to die?!

00:20:18.070 --> 00:20:19.780
Goodbye, mister!

00:20:21.070 --> 00:20:23.860
Wish I could've had
a one-on-one with ya.

00:20:28.280 --> 00:20:29.910
My prayer beads broke!

00:20:29.910 --> 00:20:31.250
That's a bad sign!

00:20:31.480 --> 00:20:32.710
No! Argo!

00:20:33.000 --> 00:20:34.210
Sai Saici!

00:20:51.520 --> 00:20:53.100
This is...

00:20:57.810 --> 00:21:00.110
Argo... Sai Saici...

00:21:12.790 --> 00:21:14.660
All so I could move on.

00:21:21.250 --> 00:21:23.260
It... It can't be.

00:21:25.010 --> 00:21:27.010
No!

00:21:30.010 --> 00:21:32.190
U-Undefeated of the East.

00:21:33.270 --> 00:21:36.790
I... I...

00:21:37.730 --> 00:21:40.110
With this crest as my witness...

00:21:40.480 --> 00:21:42.150
...I will defeat you!

00:21:42.650 --> 00:21:44.780
Along with Devil Gundam!

00:21:49.950 --> 00:21:51.950
Don't be so confident, Domon!

00:21:52.660 --> 00:21:56.040
Wait 'til you defeat this guy
before you get so cocky!

00:21:59.210 --> 00:21:59.790
What?!

00:22:04.710 --> 00:22:05.880
Chapman!

00:22:06.380 --> 00:22:07.380
Domon.

00:22:07.380 --> 00:22:09.010
Defeat him!

00:22:09.010 --> 00:22:12.230
Then claim the title, "strongest warrior"
before coming to me!

00:22:12.650 --> 00:22:16.310
I'll be waiting for you!

00:22:24.860 --> 00:22:28.660
<i>Donna yume o miteru no</i>
What are you dreaming of?

00:22:28.660 --> 00:22:31.160
<i>Odayaka na negao</i>
Your peaceful sleeping face

00:22:32.660 --> 00:22:36.450
<i>itoshikute kimi no kata</i>
Your gentle, warm shoulders

00:22:36.450 --> 00:22:39.000
<i>sotto dakiyoseta</i>
I draw them closer to me

00:22:39.960 --> 00:22:44.130
<i>hiroi kono tokai de</i>
In this great city

00:22:44.130 --> 00:22:47.800
<i>kimi to mukaeru asa ga</i>
The morning I greet with you

00:22:47.800 --> 00:22:54.510
<i>ichiban taisetsu dakara</i>
Is the most important thing to me

00:22:54.760 --> 00:23:02.060
<i>yasashisa dakeja ai wa ubaikirenai</i>
With kindness alone, one cannot find love

00:23:02.360 --> 00:23:06.610
<i>sou dareka kizutsuketemo</i>
Even if you were to hurt someone

00:23:06.820 --> 00:23:10.200
<i>kimi no egao dake wa yuzurenai</i>
I will never give up your smiling face

00:23:10.240 --> 00:23:17.660
<i>yasashisa dakeja ai wa mamorikirenai</i>
With kindness alone, one cannot protect love

00:23:17.660 --> 00:23:26.500
<i>kimidake o itsumo mitsumeteru</i>
I am always gazing only at you

00:23:33.470 --> 00:23:35.470
Everyone, it's the moment
you've been waiting for!

00:23:35.470 --> 00:23:37.930
Chapman attacks with tremendous power.

00:23:37.930 --> 00:23:40.890
Chibodee and George take on
the attack with everything they have!

00:23:41.140 --> 00:23:44.150
Rain and the others desperately
try to get past the barrier!

00:23:44.150 --> 00:23:49.240
And as Domon heads on further,
he is met by Allenby, the missing girl.

00:23:49.820 --> 00:23:52.110
Next, on Mobile Fighter
G-Gundam...

00:23:52.110 --> 00:23:56.330
Royal counterattack! Ambush 
of the Grand Gundam.

00:23:54.700 --> 00:24:01.200
Royal Counterattack!
Ambush of the Grand Gundam

00:23:56.330 --> 00:23:58.950
Ready! Go!
